# Installed as
# /usr/share/qcom-firmware-extract/provided.d/microsoft,surface-laptop8.list
#
# The SOCCP (battery, charging and USB-C) firmware. The laptop's boot firmware
# starts the SOCCP before Linux from images inside the system firmware, and
# Linux attaches to it. No Windows driver package carries these files.
qcom/glymur/microsoft/surface-laptop8/soccp.mbn
qcom/glymur/microsoft/surface-laptop8/soccp_dtb.mbn
# The USB4 router firmware. It is inside Qualcomm's Windows USB4 driver rather
# than a file of its own; surface-laptop8-usb4-firmware copies it out.
qcom/glymur/surface-laptop8/usb4-router-legacy.bin
